Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{=113}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 5,0:00:01.33,0:00:06.89,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,你們也不希望我們開放國門吧。
Dialogue: 5,0:00:06.89,0:00:08.53,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,對吧？
Dialogue: 5,0:00:09.98,0:00:15.86,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,因為為了對抗海賊，\N你們得向海賊購買武器。
Dialogue: 5,0:00:18.16,0:00:21.22,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,你們不覺得這很奇怪嗎？
Dialogue: 5,0:00:21.22,0:00:22.93,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,嗯？！
Dialogue: 5,0:00:26.89,0:00:31.46,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,你們的掮客多佛朗明哥，\N也就是喬卡，已經出局了，
Dialogue: 5,0:00:31.46,0:00:39.18,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,{\t(6620,0,1,\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}你們就別無選擇，\N只能直接跟我們交易。
Dialogue: 5,0:00:39.18,0:00:45.52,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,我知道你們走投無路，\N所以優勢在我這一邊……{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:00:47.39,0:00:50.82,Main-207+,Guernika,0,0,0,,可你們開的條件已經太過分了。{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:00:50.82,0:00:55.78,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,聽好，和之國完全自給自足！
Dialogue: 5,0:01:01.41,0:01:05.54,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,這裡的人看起來都很幸福，對吧？
Dialogue: 5,0:01:05.54,0:01:10.17,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,若說我們還缺什麼，\N那就是更強大的力量！
Dialogue: 5,0:01:10.17,0:01:13.59,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,這次我只要一艘軍艦……{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:01:14.97,0:01:19.18,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,下次，我要貝加龐克博士！
Dialogue: 5,0:01:19.18,0:01:21.01,Main-207+,Guernika,0,0,0,,那不可能！
Dialogue: 5,0:01:26.14,0:01:29.73,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,我沒問可不可能！
Dialogue: 5,0:01:34.03,0:01:37.59,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,天龍人？海軍？
Dialogue: 5,0:01:37.59,0:01:42.41,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,你知道我們才不怕他們吧？
Dialogue: 5,0:01:46.08,0:01:50.29,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,就算你們全都聯手，\N也扳不倒我們。
Dialogue: 5,0:01:50.29,0:01:54.84,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,畢竟我背後有凱多撐腰！
Dialogue: 5,0:04:00.59,0:04:05.39,Main-207+,Announcer,0,0,0,,頂級{\i1}花魁{\i0}小紫遊行來了！
Dialogue: 5,0:04:05.39,0:04:08.42,Main-207+,Spectator,0,0,0,,哦，小紫大人！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:04:08.42,0:04:11.48,Main-207+,Spectator,0,0,0,,看這邊，花魁！
Dialogue: 5,0:04:18.21,0:04:20.28,Main-207+,Toko,0,0,0,,抱歉我來遲了！
Dialogue: 5,0:04:24.07,0:04:26.12,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,我好擔心妳。
Dialogue: 5,0:04:27.49,0:04:29.79,Main-207+,Toko,0,0,0,,請原諒我，姊姊！
Dialogue: 5,0:04:29.79,0:04:31.93,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,好了，去工作吧。
Dialogue: 5,0:04:32.65,0:04:33.87,Main-207+,Toko,0,0,0,,好的！
Dialogue: 5,0:04:39.59,0:04:42.38,Main-207+,Spectator,0,0,0,,小紫大人來了！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:04:45.18,0:04:47.35,Main-207+,Spectator,0,0,0,,是{\i1}花魁{\i0}的遊行！
Dialogue: 5,0:04:48.69,0:04:49.76,Main-207+,Usopp,0,0,0,,她還沒到嗎？！
Dialogue: 5,0:04:49.76,0:04:52.86,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,這裡人山人海啊。
Dialogue: 5,0:04:52.86,0:04:56.40,Main-207+,Usopp,0,0,0,,不知道她有多美！
Dialogue: 5,0:04:56.40,0:05:00.15,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,快點啊，我心愛的小紫！
Dialogue: 5,0:05:06.20,0:05:09.08,Main-207+,Bungo,0,0,0,,那個工於心計的賤女人……
Dialogue: 5,0:05:09.08,0:05:11.16,Main-207+,Bongo,0,0,0,,……小紫！
Dialogue: 5,0:05:11.16,0:05:12.58,Main-207+,Bungo,0,0,0,,小紫！
Dialogue: 5,0:05:12.92,0:05:15.41,Main-207+,Bingo,0,0,0,,小紫……！
Dialogue: 5,0:05:17.46,0:05:19.84,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,我看他們是來找碴的！
Dialogue: 5,0:05:21.01,0:05:22.37,Main-207+,Usopp,0,0,0,,喂、喂！
Dialogue: 5,0:05:22.37,0:05:23.84,Main-207+,Bungo,0,0,0,,我一定要……
Dialogue: 5,0:05:23.84,0:05:25.88,Main-207+,Bungo,0,0,0,,宰了那個賤女人！
Dialogue: 5,0:05:26.47,0:05:29.26,Main-207+,Bingo,0,0,0,,我會被趕出城……
Dialogue: 5,0:05:29.27,0:05:31.47,Main-207+,Bingo,0,0,0,,一切都完了！
Dialogue: 5,0:05:31.47,0:05:34.22,Main-207+,Bongo,0,0,0,,反正我要死了，
Dialogue: 5,0:05:34.22,0:05:36.44,Main-207+,Bongo,0,0,0,,就拉她一起陪葬！
Dialogue: 5,0:05:46.35,0:05:48.66,Main-207+,Sandayu,0,0,0,,別靠近{\i1}花魁{\i0}！
Dialogue: 5,0:06:01.67,0:06:04.62,Main-207+,Bingo,0,0,0,,小紫……
Dialogue: 5,0:06:08.90,0:06:13.56,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,我想永遠跟妳在一起，我的愛……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.56,0:06:14.45,Main-207+,Bingo,0,0,0,,什麼？
Dialogue: 5,0:06:14.98,0:06:17.89,Main-207+,Bingo,0,0,0,,跟我這種糟老頭？！
Dialogue: 5,0:06:17.89,0:06:22.58,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,若要我一輩子當大蛇將軍的傀儡……{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:06:22.58,0:06:26.86,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,我寧願你幫我贖身……
Dialogue: 5,0:06:26.86,0:06:30.91,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,唉，可我的贖身價高得離譜，
Dialogue: 5,0:06:30.91,0:06:33.87,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,根本是不可能實現的夢……
Dialogue: 5,0:06:33.87,0:06:39.11,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,想想看，要是這番話\N傳進大蛇將軍耳裡……
Dialogue: 5,0:06:40.01,0:06:42.00,Main-207+,Bingo,0,0,0,,別擔心，我的寶貝！
Dialogue: 5,0:06:42.74,0:06:44.75,Main-207+,Bingo,0,0,0,,只要那是妳的心願，
Dialogue: 5,0:06:44.75,0:06:48.55,Main-207+,Bingo,0,0,0,,我賓果一定幫妳實現！
Dialogue: 5,0:06:50.70,0:06:52.80,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,真的嗎？
Dialogue: 5,0:06:52.80,0:06:56.98,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,就算你不是認真的，我也很開心。
Dialogue: 5,0:07:00.60,0:07:02.99,Main-207+,Bingo,0,0,0,,你竟然沒有足夠的錢還我？！
Dialogue: 5,0:07:02.99,0:07:04.47,Main-207+,Debtor,0,0,0,,對不起！
Dialogue: 5,0:07:04.47,0:07:07.11,Main-207+,Bingo,0,0,0,,你把我當傻子耍嗎？！
Dialogue: 5,0:07:07.78,0:07:10.75,Main-207+,Bingo,0,0,0,,你以為哭就有用嗎？！
Dialogue: 5,0:07:10.75,0:07:14.60,Main-207+,Bingo,0,0,0,,我要拿你的房子抵這筆借款！
Dialogue: 5,0:07:16.87,0:07:19.21,Main-207+,Bingo,0,0,0,,拿去，小紫。
Dialogue: 5,0:07:19.21,0:07:22.90,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,我從沒見過這麼多錢！
Dialogue: 5,0:07:22.90,0:07:28.41,Main-207+,Bingo,0,0,0,,小紫，這是幫妳\N贖身的訂金。
Dialogue: 5,0:07:28.41,0:07:31.29,Main-207+,Bingo,0,0,0,,雖然還不夠，\N但我要妳先收著。
Dialogue: 5,0:07:31.29,0:07:33.70,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,那麼，讓我記在帳本上吧。
Dialogue: 5,0:07:33.70,0:07:35.64,Main-207+,Bingo,0,0,0,,不必了！
Dialogue: 5,0:07:35.64,0:07:39.35,Main-207+,Bingo,0,0,0,,只有傻瓜才會不信任自己心愛的女人。
Dialogue: 5,0:07:39.35,0:07:41.89,Main-207+,Bingo,0,0,0,,妳一句話我就信了。
Dialogue: 5,0:07:41.89,0:07:43.62,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,賓果大人……{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:07:44.69,0:07:49.32,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,我等不及你帶我走的那一刻了。
Dialogue: 5,0:07:55.70,0:07:57.90,Main-207+,Bingo,0,0,0,,別哭。
Dialogue: 5,0:07:58.77,0:07:59.75,Main-207+,Bingo,0,0,0,,沒事的！
Dialogue: 5,0:07:59.75,0:08:02.64,Main-207+,Bingo,0,0,0,,我會替妳張羅喪事。{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:08:02.64,0:08:06.22,Main-207+,Bingo,0,0,0,,我還會借妳一些錢\N辦喪事和貼補生活。{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:08:09.21,0:08:11.97,Main-207+,Bingo,0,0,0,,別再哭了！
Dialogue: 5,0:08:11.97,0:08:14.94,Main-207+,Bingo,0,0,0,,妳得加倍還我！
Dialogue: 5,0:08:14.94,0:08:18.55,Main-207+,Bingo,0,0,0,,誰叫妳這麼天真，這是妳自找的！
Dialogue: 5,0:08:20.84,0:08:22.77,Main-207+,Bingo,0,0,0,,你的錢在這兒！
Dialogue: 5,0:08:22.77,0:08:25.16,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,哇！好多啊！
Dialogue: 5,0:08:26.21,0:08:27.40,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,可是……
Dialogue: 5,0:08:27.40,0:08:29.09,Main-207+,Bingo,0,0,0,,怎麼了？
Dialogue: 5,0:08:29.09,0:08:34.43,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,其實，最近有別人\N也想幫我贖身……
Dialogue: 5,0:08:34.43,0:08:35.66,Main-207+,Bingo,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 5,0:08:35.66,0:08:37.03,Main-207+,Bingo,0,0,0,,我得快點！
Dialogue: 5,0:08:37.03,0:08:42.04,Main-207+,Bingo,0,0,0,,我需要更多更多的錢來買下她……\N有什麼東西可以賣嗎？
Dialogue: 5,0:08:44.21,0:08:47.42,Main-207+,Bingo,0,0,0,,我把倉庫賣了，小紫！
Dialogue: 5,0:08:47.42,0:08:50.59,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,我真是感激不盡……
Dialogue: 5,0:08:50.59,0:08:52.59,Main-207+,Bingo's Wife,0,0,0,,夠了夠了！
Dialogue: 5,0:08:54.00,0:08:56.17,Main-207+,Bingo's Wife,0,0,0,,我受夠你了！
Dialogue: 5,0:08:56.93,0:09:00.00,Main-207+,Bingo's Wife,0,0,0,,我要回娘家！
Dialogue: 5,0:09:00.00,0:09:02.06,Main-207+,Bingo,0,0,0,,隨你便！
Dialogue: 5,0:09:04.29,0:09:08.06,Main-207+,Bingo,0,0,0,,我這就來，小紫！
Dialogue: 5,0:09:10.56,0:09:12.46,Main-207+,Bingo,0,0,0,,我連家人都拋棄了！
Dialogue: 5,0:09:14.61,0:09:18.36,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,哎呀，你得注意身體啊……{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:09:19.30,0:09:21.91,Main-207+,Bingo,0,0,0,,吃藥太浪費錢了。
Dialogue: 5,0:09:21.91,0:09:24.01,Main-207+,Bingo,0,0,0,,我沒事的。
Dialogue: 5,0:09:24.01,0:09:31.13,Main-207+,Bingo,0,0,0,,只要能得到我想要的，\N我就是世上最幸福的人。
Dialogue: 5,0:09:31.13,0:09:38.34,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,老實說，我每晚都夢見\N跟妳一起生活……
Dialogue: 5,0:09:38.34,0:09:42.19,Main-207+,Bingo,0,0,0,,啊……小紫！
Dialogue: 5,0:09:47.31,0:09:48.86,Main-207+,Bingo,0,0,0,,我湊到最後一筆了……{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:09:48.86,0:09:54.24,Main-207+,Bingo,0,0,0,,我雖然沒了房子，但我們\N可以自由地展開新生活了！
Dialogue: 5,0:09:54.24,0:09:57.24,Main-207+,Bingo,0,0,0,,我有最後的500兩。
Dialogue: 5,0:09:57.24,0:10:02.24,Main-207+,Bingo,0,0,0,,有了這個，我就能\N幫妳贖身了，小紫！
Dialogue: 5,0:10:04.20,0:10:05.45,Main-207+,Bingo,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 5,0:10:05.45,0:10:09.63,Main-207+,Brothel Staff,0,0,0,,抱歉。{\i1}花魁{\i0}今天身體不適……
Dialogue: 5,0:10:09.63,0:10:11.34,Main-207+,Bingo,0,0,0,,不會吧！
Dialogue: 5,0:10:12.07,0:10:16.46,Main-207+,Bingo,0,0,0,,只要把這個交給她就行。我晚點再來……
Dialogue: 5,0:10:22.28,0:10:24.56,Main-207+,Bingo,0,0,0,,小紫！
Dialogue: 5,0:10:24.56,0:10:31.43,Main-207+,Bingo,0,0,0,,我來帶妳離開妓院了！跟我一起過日子吧！
Dialogue: 5,0:10:42.99,0:10:45.46,Main-207+,Brothel Staff,0,0,0,,你真的上當了！
Dialogue: 5,0:10:45.46,0:10:48.62,Main-207+,Brothel Staff,0,0,0,,幹得好啊，你這老色鬼！
Dialogue: 5,0:10:49.61,0:10:52.21,Main-207+,Bingo,0,0,0,,喂，各位！
Dialogue: 5,0:10:52.21,0:10:56.81,Main-207+,Bingo,0,0,0,,別笑了，快去幫我把小紫帶來。
Dialogue: 5,0:10:58.90,0:11:03.10,Main-207+,Bingo,0,0,0,,她要跟我永遠幸福地生活下去！
Dialogue: 5,0:11:05.60,0:11:08.94,Main-207+,Brothel Staff,0,0,0,,你這蠢貨！做夢去吧！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:11:08.94,0:11:11.10,Main-207+,Brothel Staff,0,0,0,,就憑{\i1}你{\i0}也有錢幫她贖身？{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:11:11.10,0:11:15.73,Main-207+,Bingo,0,0,0,,我當然有！錢就在小紫那兒！\N我請她幫我保管的！
Dialogue: 5,0:11:17.70,0:11:20.15,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,哎呀……是賓果先生。{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:11:20.15,0:11:24.67,Main-207+,Bingo,0,0,0,,哦，小紫！請妳說句公道話！
Dialogue: 5,0:11:24.67,0:11:30.24,Main-207+,Bingo,0,0,0,,他們胡說八道，\N根本不知道我倆有多情深意重！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:11:30.24,0:11:31.60,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,哦？
Dialogue: 5,0:11:33.00,0:11:37.67,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,那筆錢是你給我的，不是嗎？{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:11:38.39,0:11:39.22,Main-207+,Bingo,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 5,0:11:45.83,0:11:48.97,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,我早就全花光了。
Dialogue: 5,0:11:50.01,0:11:51.56,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,不過還是謝謝你。
Dialogue: 5,0:11:53.79,0:11:59.32,Main-207+,Brothel Staff,0,0,0,,這老頭還真以為\N小紫愛上他了！
Dialogue: 5,0:12:12.70,0:12:15.88,Main-207+,Denjiro,0,0,0,,這老不死的搞什麼啊？
Dialogue: 5,0:12:15.88,0:12:16.71,Main-207+,Bingo,0,0,0,,什麼？
Dialogue: 5,0:12:16.71,0:12:18.67,Main-207+,Denjiro,0,0,0,,小紫……
Dialogue: 5,0:12:20.67,0:12:23.34,Main-207+,Bingo,0,0,0,,狂……狂死郎老大！
Dialogue: 5,0:12:24.20,0:12:25.72,Main-207+,Denjiro,0,0,0,,原來……
Dialogue: 5,0:12:25.72,0:12:30.85,Main-207+,Denjiro,0,0,0,,你就是最近老在\N小紫身邊晃悠的那個老頭……
Dialogue: 5,0:12:30.85,0:12:34.40,Main-207+,Bingo,0,0,0,,晃悠……？讓、讓我解釋！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:12:34.40,0:12:37.98,Main-207+,Bingo,0,0,0,,小紫，這是開玩笑的吧？
Dialogue: 5,0:12:40.57,0:12:44.50,Main-207+,Bingo,0,0,0,,我真的把一切都獻出去了！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:12:44.50,0:12:46.74,Main-207+,Bingo,0,0,0,,我什麼都不剩了！
Dialogue: 5,0:12:46.74,0:12:50.66,Main-207+,Bingo,0,0,0,,我為了妳把一切都放棄了！
Dialogue: 5,0:13:01.10,0:13:02.92,Main-207+,Brothel Staff,0,0,0,,那麼……
Dialogue: 5,0:13:02.92,0:13:05.21,Main-207+,Brothel Staff,0,0,0,,這已經是第幾個上當的傻瓜了？
Dialogue: 5,0:13:05.21,0:13:09.50,Main-207+,Brothel Staff,0,0,0,,我們可不能讓你在這兒哭鬧\N妨礙做生意，老頭。
Dialogue: 5,0:13:09.50,0:13:13.18,Main-207+,Brothel Staff,0,0,0,,完事了就滾吧！
Dialogue: 5,0:13:13.89,0:13:16.52,Main-207+,Brothel Staff,0,0,0,,你這好色的老東西！
Dialogue: 5,0:13:22.36,0:13:24.86,Main-207+,Bingo,0,0,0,,住手！
Dialogue: 5,0:13:24.86,0:13:26.86,Main-207+,Bingo,0,0,0,,住手……！
Dialogue: 5,0:13:27.78,0:13:29.78,Main-207+,Bingo,0,0,0,,我走！
Dialogue: 5,0:13:29.78,0:13:33.20,Main-207+,Bingo,0,0,0,,我走還不行嗎，住手吧！
Dialogue: 5,0:13:45.00,0:13:46.93,Main-207+,Bingo,0,0,0,,小紫……！
Dialogue: 5,0:13:54.40,0:13:57.60,Main-207+,Announcer,0,0,0,,頂級{\i1}花魁{\i0}小紫……
Dialogue: 5,0:14:00.40,0:14:03.93,Main-207+,Announcer,0,0,0,,……遊行來了！
Dialogue: 5,0:14:08.00,0:14:10.83,Main-207+,Spectator,0,0,0,,– 小紫大人！\N– 小紫大人！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:14:15.48,0:14:17.33,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,她真美！
Dialogue: 5,0:14:17.33,0:14:19.71,Main-207+,Usopp,0,0,0,,她太美豔了！
Dialogue: 5,0:14:24.46,0:14:26.89,Main-207+,Spectator,0,0,0,,哦，她好漂亮……！
Dialogue: 5,0:14:26.89,0:14:29.47,Main-207+,Spectator,0,0,0,,她光彩照人！我的眼睛啊！
Dialogue: 5,0:14:33.51,0:14:35.39,Main-207+,Bungo,0,0,0,,小紫！
Dialogue: 5,0:14:35.39,0:14:38.60,Main-207+,Bongo,0,0,0,,我賣了房子、賣了家人，\N把一切都賣光了！
Dialogue: 5,0:14:38.60,0:14:43.80,Main-207+,Bongo,0,0,0,,把錢還給我，你這騙子！
Dialogue: 5,0:14:45.40,0:14:48.07,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,想討回你送出去的禮物？
Dialogue: 5,0:14:48.75,0:14:51.69,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,真是可悲的醜態……{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:14:52.37,0:14:57.50,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,對我來說，男人不過是\N替我賺錢的狗。
Dialogue: 5,0:14:57.50,0:15:00.33,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,若你再也做不到這點，\N你對我來說就是個死人。
Dialogue: 5,0:15:05.00,0:15:07.51,Main-207+,Official,0,0,0,,各位，你們只能到此為止了！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:15:08.81,0:15:11.51,Main-207+,Official,0,0,0,,錢包空了的，就給我滾！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:15:11.51,0:15:15.72,Main-207+,Official,0,0,0,,賺不了錢的人，\N在花都沒有容身之處。
Dialogue: 5,0:15:15.72,0:15:20.27,Main-207+,Official,0,0,0,,以大蛇將軍之名，\N我們要把你們逐出城去！
Dialogue: 5,0:15:23.39,0:15:25.40,Main-207+,Bongo,0,0,0,,求求你別這樣！
Dialogue: 5,0:15:25.40,0:15:29.40,Main-207+,Bongo,0,0,0,,城外的環境根本不是人待的！
Dialogue: 5,0:15:29.40,0:15:31.99,Main-207+,Bungo,0,0,0,,該死！你們下地獄去吧！
Dialogue: 5,0:15:31.99,0:15:35.13,Main-207+,Bungo,0,0,0,,小紫！
Dialogue: 5,0:15:36.10,0:15:40.41,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,我對窮人……
Dialogue: 5,0:15:40.41,0:15:43.08,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,……只有鄙視。
Dialogue: 5,0:16:00.35,0:16:03.17,Main-207+,Announcer,0,0,0,,開門！
Dialogue: 5,0:16:11.12,0:16:15.74,Main-207+,Announcer,0,0,0,,頂級{\i1}花魁{\i0}小紫駕到！
Dialogue: 5,0:16:33.88,0:16:36.81,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,桃，原來你有個妹妹啊？
Dialogue: 5,0:16:36.81,0:16:38.01,Main-207+,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,喂，阿玉！
Dialogue: 5,0:16:38.01,0:16:41.43,Main-207+,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,竟敢對我如此無禮！\N你以為我是誰？！
Dialogue: 5,0:16:41.43,0:16:42.94,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,你就是桃啊。
Dialogue: 5,0:16:43.94,0:16:45.06,Main-207+,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,算了。
Dialogue: 5,0:16:46.65,0:16:49.39,Main-207+,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,沒錯，我有個妹妹。
Dialogue: 5,0:16:49.39,0:16:51.53,Main-207+,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,若她還活著，今年應該二十六歲了。{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:16:52.41,0:16:57.99,Main-207+,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,我母親的死有人目擊，\N但沒人證實日和是否也死了。
Dialogue: 5,0:16:57.99,0:17:02.83,Main-207+,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,所以我堅信她一定還活在某處！
Dialogue: 5,0:17:02.83,0:17:05.17,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,希望你能再見到她。
Dialogue: 5,0:17:05.17,0:17:07.08,Main-207+,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,唉，我是見不到了！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:17:07.08,0:17:11.51,Main-207+,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,若她的身分曝光，\N大蛇就會盯上她！
Dialogue: 5,0:17:12.40,0:17:15.57,Main-207+,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,我們要等到戰勝的那一天才能重逢！
Dialogue: 5,0:17:21.64,0:17:26.46,Main-207+,Minatomo,0,0,0,,就因為某個{\i1}花魁{\i0}太美，\N你就敢上工遲到，阿佛朗？！
Dialogue: 5,0:17:26.46,0:17:27.94,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,不，老大！
Dialogue: 5,0:17:27.94,0:17:29.77,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,真的非常抱歉！
Dialogue: 5,0:17:30.70,0:17:34.07,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,我是說，實在難以相信\N世上竟有這樣的美人！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:17:35.92,0:17:39.05,Main-207+,Minatomo,0,0,0,,我懂你的感受！
Dialogue: 5,0:17:42.84,0:17:47.50,Main-207+,Minatomo,0,0,0,,但你知道我還有名聲\N要顧的，你這笨蛋！
Dialogue: 5,0:17:50.25,0:17:53.01,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,是！真的很抱歉！
Dialogue: 5,0:17:53.01,0:17:59.47,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,{\q2}我絕無意玷汙\N傳說中的木匠大師港友之名！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:18:00.10,0:18:03.31,Main-207+,Minatomo,0,0,0,,既然你的活兒比別人\N多做了十倍，{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:18:03.31,0:18:06.33,Main-207+,Minatomo,0,0,0,,那我想，偶爾翹個班\N我也就不計較了。
Dialogue: 5,0:18:06.33,0:18:11.86,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,你若肯把你建造的\N鬼島要塞圖紙給我看看，
Dialogue: 5,0:18:11.86,0:18:12.90,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,我就多做十——{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:18:12.90,0:18:17.07,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,不對！多做一百倍的活兒！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:18:17.99,0:18:19.63,Main-207+,Minatomo,0,0,0,,哦，對了。
Dialogue: 5,0:18:19.63,0:18:26.16,Main-207+,Minatomo,0,0,0,,關於你一直跟我要的\N那些鬼島宅邸圖紙……{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:18:26.16,0:18:29.12,Main-207+,Minatomo,0,0,0,,關於那些……呃……
Dialogue: 5,0:18:33.50,0:18:36.47,Main-207+,Minatomo,0,0,0,,哦，這只是張衛生紙。
Dialogue: 5,0:18:37.50,0:18:38.63,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,哦，別這樣啊！
Dialogue: 5,0:18:41.09,0:18:42.35,Main-207+,Minatomo,0,0,0,,關於那些……
Dialogue: 5,0:18:46.68,0:18:48.44,Main-207+,Minatomo,0,0,0,,我想起來了……
Dialogue: 5,0:18:50.89,0:18:54.32,Main-207+,Minatomo,0,0,0,,我大概十年前就把它們當掉了！
Dialogue: 5,0:19:08.59,0:19:14.17,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,你以為我這幾週\N到底是為了什麼替你賣命？！
Dialogue: 5,0:19:14.17,0:19:17.63,Main-207+,Minatomo,0,0,0,,哎喲！該死，住手啊，阿佛朗！
Dialogue: 5,0:19:21.55,0:19:25.18,Main-207+,Minatomo,0,0,0,,你竟敢襲擊師傅！\N你以為你是誰？！
Dialogue: 5,0:19:25.18,0:19:27.31,Main-207+,Minatomo,0,0,0,,你這死腦筋！
Dialogue: 5,0:19:27.31,0:19:29.48,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,你快把我逼瘋了！
Dialogue: 5,0:19:31.23,0:19:32.27,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,吃我這招！
Dialogue: 5,0:19:32.27,0:19:35.48,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}佛朗之助火箭發射器！
Dialogue: 5,0:19:40.78,0:19:43.87,Main-207+,Minatomo,0,0,0,,你被開除了！給我滾，你這蠢貨！
Dialogue: 5,0:19:43.87,0:19:46.49,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,求之不得！反正我在這兒\N也沒事可做了！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:19:49.21,0:19:52.79,Main-207+,Hanji,0,0,0,,十年前當掉的圖紙？
Dialogue: 5,0:19:53.51,0:19:56.67,Main-207+,Hanji,0,0,0,,我們很少會收那種東西……{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:19:58.99,0:20:00.38,Main-207+,Hanji,0,0,0,,哦，說不定是那些！
Dialogue: 5,0:20:00.38,0:20:02.72,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,什麼？你有嗎？！
Dialogue: 5,0:20:02.72,0:20:07.07,Main-207+,Hanji,0,0,0,,這個嘛，它們早就\N轉到別人手上了……{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:20:07.07,0:20:09.77,Main-207+,Hanji,0,0,0,,那麼，會是誰買了那種東西呢……？{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:20:09.77,0:20:12.89,Main-207+,Hanji,0,0,0,,嗯，是誰來著……？
Dialogue: 5,0:20:12.89,0:20:15.61,Main-207+,Hanji,0,0,0,,呃……
Dialogue: 5,0:20:16.42,0:20:17.69,Main-207+,Hanji,0,0,0,,哦，對了！
Dialogue: 5,0:20:18.34,0:20:22.70,Main-207+,Hanji,0,0,0,,是長屋的熊五郎。\N他說要拿去研究。肯定沒錯！
Dialogue: 5,0:20:24.00,0:20:25.16,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,誰？！
Dialogue: 5,0:20:25.16,0:20:25.20,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,{\clip(885,950,1077,1056)}誰？！
Dialogue: 5,0:20:25.20,0:20:25.24,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,{\clip(941,950,1016,1056)}誰？！
Dialogue: 5,0:20:25.24,0:20:25.28,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,{\clip(965,950,986,1056)}誰？！
Dialogue: 5,0:20:26.10,0:20:28.79,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,熊五郎！
Dialogue: 5,0:20:28.79,0:20:30.79,Main-207+,Kumagoro,0,0,0,,圖紙？
Dialogue: 5,0:20:30.79,0:20:34.10,Main-207+,Kumagoro,0,0,0,,哦對，我確實一度有過，
Dialogue: 5,0:20:34.10,0:20:38.55,Main-207+,Kumagoro,0,0,0,,但我付不出房租，\N就被房東寇貝先生拿走了。
Dialogue: 5,0:20:39.59,0:20:41.47,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,那又是誰啊？
Dialogue: 5,0:20:41.47,0:20:41.51,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,{\clip(717,939,1238,1056)}那又是誰啊？
Dialogue: 5,0:20:41.51,0:20:41.55,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,{\clip(837,939,1107,1056)}那又是誰啊？
Dialogue: 5,0:20:41.55,0:20:41.59,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,{\clip(909,939,1019,1056)}那又是誰啊？
Dialogue: 5,0:20:41.59,0:20:41.63,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,{\clip(954,939,980,1056)}那又是誰啊？
Dialogue: 5,0:20:42.42,0:20:44.13,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,寇貝！
Dialogue: 5,0:20:44.13,0:20:49.99,Main-207+,Kobe,0,0,0,,哦，那些圖紙啊。品質很好，\N我就送給我最中意的藝妓了。
Dialogue: 5,0:20:49.99,0:20:50.97,Main-207+,Kobe,0,0,0,,紀瀨川小姐。{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:20:50.97,0:20:52.40,Main-207+,Kobe,0,0,0,,你認識她嗎？
Dialogue: 5,0:20:52.40,0:20:53.48,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,不認識！
Dialogue: 5,0:20:53.48,0:20:53.52,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,{\clip(795,894,1145,1067)}不認識！
Dialogue: 5,0:20:53.52,0:20:53.56,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,{\clip(875,894,1055,1067)}不認識！
Dialogue: 5,0:20:53.56,0:20:53.60,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,{\clip(923,894,995,1067)}不認識！
Dialogue: 5,0:20:53.60,0:20:53.64,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,{\clip(947,894,969,1067)}不認識！
Dialogue: 5,0:20:54.48,0:20:59.23,Main-207+,Kisegawa,0,0,0,,我不知道拿它們怎麼辦，\N就當成盤墊用了，可後來時次郎……
Dialogue: 5,0:20:59.23,0:21:01.49,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,好，那又是誰啊？{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:21:01.49,0:21:01.53,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,{\clip(m 603 957 l 1046 957 1046 1053 603 1069)}好，那又是誰啊？{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:21:01.53,0:21:01.57,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,{\clip(m 603 957 l 813 957 810.33 1061 605 1073)}好，那又是誰啊？{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:21:01.86,0:21:01.90,Main-207+,Tokijiro,0,0,0,,{\clip(1064,971,1140,1061)}東西在我這兒！
Dialogue: 5,0:21:01.90,0:21:01.94,Main-207+,Tokijiro,0,0,0,,{\clip(834,971,1140,1061)}東西在我這兒！
Dialogue: 5,0:21:01.94,0:21:03.78,Main-207+,Tokijiro,0,0,0,,東西在我這兒！
Dialogue: 5,0:21:03.78,0:21:06.99,Main-207+,Tokijiro,0,0,0,,但駱駝說能賣個好價錢\N就把它們拿走了！
Dialogue: 5,0:21:06.99,0:21:09.70,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,什麼？「駱駝」？！是動物拿走的？！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:21:09.70,0:21:09.74,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,{\clip(m 312 859.5 l 1180.5 867 1287 1048.5 312 1048.5)}什麼？「駱駝」？！是動物拿走的？！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:21:09.74,0:21:09.79,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,{\clip(m 312 859.5 l 1069.5 868.5 1183.5 1048.5 312 1048.5)}什麼？「駱駝」？！是動物拿走的？！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:21:09.79,0:21:09.83,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,{\clip(m 312 859.5 l 961.5 868.5 1074 1048.5 312 1048.5)}什麼？「駱駝」？！是動物拿走的？！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:21:09.83,0:21:09.87,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,{\clip(m 312 859.5 l 861 864 961.5 1048.5 312 1048.5)}什麼？「駱駝」？！是動物拿走的？！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:21:09.87,0:21:09.91,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,{\clip(m 312 859.5 l 738 861 855 1048.5 312 1048.5)}什麼？「駱駝」？！是動物拿走的？！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:21:09.91,0:21:09.95,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,{\clip(m 312 859.5 l 628.5 868.5 753 1048.5 312 1048.5)}什麼？「駱駝」？！是動物拿走的？！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:21:09.95,0:21:09.99,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,{\clip(m 312 957 l 579 960 639 1048.5 312 1048.5)}什麼？「駱駝」？！是動物拿走的？！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.99,0:21:10.04,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,{\clip(m 326 960 l 490 978 554 1060 304 1062)}什麼？「駱駝」？！是動物拿走的？！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.04,0:21:10.08,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,{\clip(m 316 970 l 390 988 444 1054 274 1048)}什麼？「駱駝」？！是動物拿走的？！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:21:10.81,0:21:12.77,Main-207+,The Camel,0,0,0,,大家都叫我駱駝！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:21:12.77,0:21:16.23,Main-207+,The Camel,0,0,0,,唉，那些圖紙\N給我惹了一堆麻煩！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:21:16.23,0:21:18.29,Main-207+,The Camel,0,0,0,,有個傢伙把它們給搶走了！
Dialogue: 5,0:21:18.29,0:21:23.55,Main-207+,The Camel,0,0,0,,他蒙著臉，\N但他說他是從九里來的。{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:21:23.55,0:21:26.10,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,500)}九里？！
Dialogue: 5,0:21:30.31,0:21:30.93,Main-207+,Customer,0,0,0,,呃……
Dialogue: 5,0:21:30.93,0:21:34.00,Main-207+,Kanjuro,0,0,0,,哦，抱歉。這是鯛魚。
Dialogue: 5,0:21:34.00,0:21:36.23,Main-207+,Customer,0,0,0,,鯛魚平常長這樣嗎？
Dialogue: 5,0:21:36.23,0:21:39.11,Main-207+,Kanjuro,0,0,0,,很高興跟你做生意！
Dialogue: 5,0:21:43.03,0:21:44.49,Main-207+,Kanjuro,0,0,0,,佛朗之助大人！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:21:46.40,0:21:48.24,Main-207+,Kanjuro,0,0,0,,你看起來心情很好嘛。
Dialogue: 5,0:21:48.24,0:21:51.37,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,那當然！不過你到底\N在賣什麼啊？{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:21:51.37,0:21:55.09,Main-207+,Kanjuro,0,0,0,,什麼？哦，我在賣魚。
Dialogue: 5,0:21:55.09,0:21:58.79,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,你太顯眼了！\N小孩都被你吸引過來了！
Dialogue: 5,0:21:58.79,0:22:04.91,Main-207+,Kanjuro,0,0,0,,話說回來，你剛才怎麼那麼急？\N出什麼事了嗎？
Dialogue: 5,0:22:04.91,0:22:10.35,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,哦對！別提顯不顯眼了！\N我們有更要緊的事！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:22:10.35,0:22:16.06,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,我原以為圖紙在\N那傢伙手上，結果根本沒有！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:22:17.55,0:22:20.56,Main-207+,Inuarashi,0,0,0,,接著去查那邊的刀劍。
Dialogue: 5,0:22:20.56,0:22:25.74,Main-207+,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,什麼？！凱多宅邸的圖紙\N就在九里這裡？！
Dialogue: 5,0:22:25.74,0:22:30.45,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,{\i1}對！我找遍了整個花都\N也沒找到！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:22:30.45,0:22:33.15,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,{\i1}我現在也不知道該怎麼辦才好！
Dialogue: 5,0:22:34.21,0:22:36.66,Main-207+,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,真是辛苦你了。
Dialogue: 5,0:22:36.66,0:22:40.75,Main-207+,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,佛朗之助大人，請去幫其他人\N完成在花都的任務吧。
Dialogue: 5,0:22:40.75,0:22:42.39,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,{\i1}知道了！
Dialogue: 5,0:22:42.38,0:22:43.11,Main-207+,Snail,0,0,0,,{Clank.}
Dialogue: 5,0:22:43.60,0:22:48.52,Main-207+,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,嗯……究竟是誰\N想要凱多宅邸的圖紙呢？
Dialogue: 5,0:22:48.52,0:22:49.91,Main-207+,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,難道是……？
Dialogue: 5,0:22:50.80,0:22:52.72,Main-207+,Wanda,0,0,0,,少爺！錦大人！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:22:52.72,0:22:54.77,Main-207+,Carrot,0,0,0,,嘿！
Dialogue: 5,0:22:55.47,0:22:56.77,Main-207+,Wanda,0,0,0,,呼！
Dialogue: 5,0:22:56.77,0:23:01.94,Main-207+,Wanda,0,0,0,,看看我們搶到多少東西！\N有工廠的糧食，還有武器！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:23:01.94,0:23:05.15,Main-207+,Inuarashi,0,0,0,,幹得好。留下犯案字條了嗎？
Dialogue: 5,0:23:05.15,0:23:06.78,Main-207+,Carrot,0,0,0,,當然留了！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:23:08.65,0:23:10.55,Main-207+,Carrot,0,0,0,,不過，我們該這麼做嗎？{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:23:10.55,0:23:16.20,Main-207+,Carrot,0,0,0,,那張字條可能會害\N百獸海賊團去攻擊阿修羅童子。
Dialogue: 5,0:23:16.20,0:23:20.58,Main-207+,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,那正是我們要的。\N遭到攻擊會激怒他。
Dialogue: 5,0:23:20.58,0:23:25.42,Main-207+,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,若不利用他的怒火\N逼他去對抗百獸海賊團……
Dialogue: 5,0:23:25.42,0:23:28.68,Main-207+,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,我們就永遠無法\N重新點燃他心中的火。
Dialogue: 5,0:23:31.69,0:23:38.21,Main-207+,Inuarashi,0,0,0,,想想他二十年來承受的悔恨，\N這手段是有點狠了。
Dialogue: 5,0:23:38.21,0:23:39.60,Main-207+,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,我知道！
Dialogue: 5,0:23:39.60,0:23:45.23,Main-207+,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,但無論手段是正是邪，\N想扳倒凱多就少不了他！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:23:45.90,0:23:48.69,Main-207+,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,我們需要阿修羅童子的幫助！
Dialogue: 5,0:23:51.40,0:23:54.87,Main-207+,Yasuie,0,0,0,,嘿！我回來啦！
Dialogue: 5,0:24:00.41,0:24:01.79,Main-207+,Citizen,0,0,0,,阿康！
Dialogue: 5,0:24:02.79,0:24:05.96,Main-207+,Citizen,0,0,0,,哦，你回來啦，多康！
Dialogue: 5,0:24:05.96,0:24:09.59,Main-207+,Citizen,0,0,0,,阿康，你回來了，可我們\N還是沒東西吃啊！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:24:11.08,0:24:12.76,Main-207+,Citizen,0,0,0,,我好餓！
Dialogue: 5,0:24:13.69,0:24:15.55,Main-207+,Citizen,0,0,0,,我快餓死了！
Dialogue: 5,0:24:24.80,0:24:27.40,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,他們怎麼還這麼開朗？
Dialogue: 5,0:24:27.40,0:24:28.86,Main-207+,Yasuie,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 5,0:24:28.86,0:24:33.20,Main-207+,Yasuie,0,0,0,,你反應真快，大哥！\N這裡每個人看起來都很幸福，對吧？！
Dialogue: 5,0:24:33.94,0:24:36.66,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,這跟九里的施捨小鎮\N稍微有點不一樣。
Dialogue: 5,0:24:39.07,0:24:43.79,Main-207+,Yasuie,0,0,0,,在所有生物當中，\N只有人類會笑！
Dialogue: 5,0:24:43.79,0:24:44.67,Main-207+,Yasuie,0,0,0,,沒錯！
Dialogue: 5,0:24:44.67,0:24:48.90,Main-207+,Yasuie,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}♪ 所以你就得笑一笑！ ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.68,0:24:52.76,Main-207+,Yasuie,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}♪ 你就得笑一笑！ ♪{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.97,0:24:57.28,Main-207+,Yasuie,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}♪ 你就得笑一笑！ ♪{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:25:00.72,0:25:02.68,Main-207+,Geisha,0,0,0,,打擾了！
Dialogue: 5,0:25:11.59,0:25:12.99,Main-207+,Official,0,0,0,,– 大蛇將軍！\N– 大蛇將軍！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:25:21.20,0:25:25.12,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,別拘束！都抬起頭來吧！
Dialogue: 5,0:25:26.33,0:25:30.09,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,好了，晚餐吃什麼？
Dialogue: 5,0:25:30.09,0:25:33.38,Main-207+,Official,0,0,0,,是！全都準備好了！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:25:33.38,0:25:34.62,Main-207+,Official,0,0,0,,端上來！
Dialogue: 5,0:25:37.34,0:25:39.22,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,哦！
Dialogue: 5,0:25:39.22,0:25:43.40,Main-207+,Official,0,0,0,,我們宰了在大蛇農場\N優美環境裡飼養的雞，
Dialogue: 5,0:25:43.40,0:25:45.06,Main-207+,Official,0,0,0,,再稍微汆燙一下……
Dialogue: 5,0:25:45.06,0:25:47.06,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,不！我不想吃雞！
Dialogue: 5,0:25:47.06,0:25:49.60,Main-207+,Official,0,0,0,,遵命，大人！我們這就丟掉！
Dialogue: 5,0:25:49.60,0:25:51.10,Main-207+,Official,0,0,0,,端走！
Dialogue: 5,0:25:51.10,0:25:52.15,Main-207+,Official,0,0,0,,下一道！
Dialogue: 5,0:25:52.15,0:25:54.45,Main-207+,Official,0,0,0,,這些新鮮美味的蔬菜……
Dialogue: 5,0:25:54.45,0:25:55.37,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,我不要！
Dialogue: 5,0:25:55.37,0:25:57.28,Main-207+,Official,0,0,0,,遵命，大人！我們這就扔了！
Dialogue: 5,0:25:57.28,0:25:58.36,Main-207+,Official,0,0,0,,下一道！
Dialogue: 5,0:25:59.39,0:26:02.45,Main-207+,Official,0,0,0,,為您獻上最上等、\N最肥美的秋刀魚！
Dialogue: 5,0:26:03.62,0:26:06.00,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,我喜歡秋刀魚！
Dialogue: 5,0:26:06.00,0:26:07.92,Main-207+,Official,0,0,0,,還有鮪魚生魚片！
Dialogue: 5,0:26:07.91,0:26:10.79,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,好啊！鮪魚最棒了！鮪魚！
Dialogue: 5,0:26:10.79,0:26:14.88,Main-207+,Official,0,0,0,,我們還精選了和之國\N各地的清酒……{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:26:14.88,0:26:16.84,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,我懂了！
Dialogue: 5,0:26:18.41,0:26:21.73,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,你當然有喝不完的酒！
Dialogue: 5,0:26:21.73,0:26:24.12,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,但女人呢？
Dialogue: 5,0:26:24.12,0:26:25.77,Main-207+,Official,0,0,0,,當然，馬上就來！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:26:25.77,0:26:27.89,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,好！很好！
Dialogue: 5,0:26:33.98,0:26:36.92,Main-207+,Child,0,0,0,,媽，我肚子餓！
Dialogue: 5,0:26:36.92,0:26:38.78,Main-207+,Child,0,0,0,,我也是！
Dialogue: 5,0:26:41.57,0:26:45.45,Main-207+,Citizen,0,0,0,,我因為營養不良掉了顆牙！
Dialogue: 5,0:26:46.90,0:26:49.28,Main-207+,Citizen,0,0,0,,反正你也沒東西可嚼！
Dialogue: 5,0:26:51.17,0:26:54.96,Main-207+,Citizen,0,0,0,,好了，多康，這位浪人朋友是誰啊？
Dialogue: 5,0:26:54.96,0:26:57.76,Main-207+,Citizen,0,0,0,,他腰上佩了三把刀呢！
Dialogue: 5,0:26:58.76,0:27:01.58,Main-207+,Citizen,0,0,0,,你說得對！三把刀！
Dialogue: 5,0:27:01.58,0:27:03.26,Main-207+,Citizen,0,0,0,,而且全是長刀！
Dialogue: 5,0:27:03.26,0:27:05.10,Main-207+,Citizen,0,0,0,,你是想搞笑嗎？！
Dialogue: 5,0:27:07.09,0:27:11.79,Main-207+,Yasuie,0,0,0,,哇哇！我可欣賞這位老兄！
Dialogue: 5,0:27:11.79,0:27:16.40,Main-207+,Citizen,0,0,0,,哎呀！真抱歉，讓你被\N這個怪人纏上了。
Dialogue: 5,0:27:16.40,0:27:19.82,Main-207+,Yasuie,0,0,0,,錯了！我可是世界第一的馬屁精！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:27:19.82,0:27:22.02,Main-207+,Yasuie,0,0,0,,對吧，帥哥？！
Dialogue: 5,0:27:23.00,0:27:27.50,Main-207+,Citizen,0,0,0,,他確實是啦，可你瞧！\N他一臉兇相！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:27:27.50,0:27:31.83,Main-207+,Citizen,0,0,0,,來嘛，年輕人。收起那副嚇人的表情。
Dialogue: 5,0:27:34.55,0:27:36.71,Main-207+,Citizen,0,0,0,,給我們笑一個！
Dialogue: 5,0:27:36.71,0:27:40.30,Main-207+,Citizen,0,0,0,,就算在惠比壽這種悲慘的破地方，\N也會有好事發生！
Dialogue: 5,0:27:40.30,0:27:44.97,Main-207+,Yasuie,0,0,0,,等等，你是說{\i1}他{\i0}\N來過這個鎮上？！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:27:44.97,0:27:49.93,Main-207+,Citizen,0,0,0,,沒錯！丑三小僧\N又來我們這兒了！
Dialogue: 5,0:27:51.52,0:27:53.31,Main-207+,Yasuie,0,0,0,,那太好了！
Dialogue: 5,0:27:53.31,0:27:55.48,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,丑三什麼？{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:27:55.48,0:27:59.40,Main-207+,Citizen,0,0,0,,對啊，我們一有難他就會來！
Dialogue: 5,0:27:59.40,0:28:02.83,Main-207+,Citizen,0,0,0,,我們甚至不知道他是誰。
Dialogue: 5,0:28:04.12,0:28:07.90,Main-207+,Citizen,0,0,0,,他總在深夜丑時三刻現身，
Dialogue: 5,0:28:07.90,0:28:11.46,Main-207+,Citizen,0,0,0,,從花都那些為富不仁的\N壞人手裡偷錢……{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:28:19.40,0:28:23.69,Main-207+,Citizen,0,0,0,,再把錢放到窮人的長屋，\N然後消失無蹤。
Dialogue: 5,0:28:23.69,0:28:26.63,Main-207+,Citizen,0,0,0,,真不知道他到底是誰。
Dialogue: 5,0:28:26.63,0:28:29.51,Main-207+,Yasuie,0,0,0,,謝天謝地，謝天謝地！
Dialogue: 5,0:28:30.60,0:28:32.94,Main-207+,Citizen,0,0,0,,幸運會降臨在愛笑的人身上！
Dialogue: 5,0:28:32.94,0:28:37.16,Main-207+,Citizen,0,0,0,,所以我們湊錢\N給自己買了點好東西犒賞一下！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:28:38.32,0:28:41.15,Main-207+,Yasuie,0,0,0,,哦！什麼好東西？！
Dialogue: 5,0:28:41.15,0:28:43.13,Main-207+,Citizen,0,0,0,,就是這個！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:28:43.13,0:28:44.41,Main-207+,Citizen,0,0,0,,你瞧？
Dialogue: 5,0:28:44.41,0:28:46.28,Main-207+,Citizen,0,0,0,,就是這個！
Dialogue: 5,0:28:47.19,0:28:49.12,Main-207+,Koito,0,0,0,,請喝一杯！
Dialogue: 5,0:28:50.85,0:28:52.46,Main-207+,Koito,0,0,0,,你也該來一點！
Dialogue: 5,0:28:54.19,0:28:56.00,Main-207+,Koito,0,0,0,,是清水啊！
Dialogue: 5,0:28:56.00,0:28:58.34,Main-207+,Koito,0,0,0,,這是我們用得來的錢買的！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:29:01.84,0:29:04.05,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,不，我不該喝……
Dialogue: 5,0:29:04.05,0:29:05.73,Main-207+,Koito,0,0,0,,別客氣！
Dialogue: 5,0:29:06.89,0:29:11.39,Main-207+,Koito,0,0,0,,這水很乾淨，喝了\N不會鬧肚子的！
Dialogue: 5,0:29:11.39,0:29:16.09,Main-207+,Citizen,0,0,0,,是阿康帶你來的，\N所以你一定是個好人！
Dialogue: 5,0:29:20.52,0:29:22.80,Main-207+,Yasuie,0,0,0,,別害羞！
Dialogue: 5,0:29:22.80,0:29:27.62,Main-207+,Yasuie,0,0,0,,儘管喝吧！每個人\N都有喝的權利！
Dialogue: 5,0:29:27.62,0:29:29.74,Main-207+,Koito,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}♪ 美味的水！ ♪
Dialogue: 5,0:29:29.74,0:29:31.74,Main-207+,Koito,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}♪ 清澈的水！ ♪
Dialogue: 5,0:29:31.74,0:29:34.08,Main-207+,Koito,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}♪ 美味的水！ ♪
Dialogue: 5,0:29:34.08,0:29:36.21,Main-207+,Koito,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}♪ 清澈的水！ ♪
Dialogue: 5,0:29:36.21,0:29:40.63,Main-207+,Koito,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}♪ 美味的水！清澈的水！ ♪
Dialogue: 5,0:29:40.63,0:29:44.68,Main-207+,Koito,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}♪ 美味的水！清澈的水！ ♪
Dialogue: 5,0:29:44.68,0:29:49.34,Main-207+,Koito,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}♪ 美味的水！清澈的水！ ♪
Dialogue: 5,0:30:02.03,0:30:04.94,Main-207+,Citizen,0,0,0,,好喝吧？！它滲進你\N全身每一寸，對吧？！
Dialogue: 5,0:30:05.78,0:30:08.53,Main-207+,Citizen,0,0,0,,又露出那副兇相了！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:30:10.95,0:30:14.09,Main-207+,Citizen,0,0,0,,笑一個，不然幸運不會眷顧你的！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:30:14.79,0:30:18.42,Main-207+,Yasuie,0,0,0,,在這個國家，我們把\N每個人的笑臉
Dialogue: 5,0:30:18.42,0:30:22.42,Main-207+,Yasuie,0,0,0,,都叫做惠比壽笑臉，大哥！
Dialogue: 5,0:30:22.42,0:30:25.45,Main-207+,Yasuie,0,0,0,,所以這地方才叫惠比壽町！
Dialogue: 5,0:30:25.45,0:30:28.55,Main-207+,Yasuie,0,0,0,,我們不會被貧窮打倒！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:30:28.55,0:30:32.56,Main-207+,Yasuie,0,0,0,,♪ 哭泣治不好你的窮！ ♪\N♪ 所以你就得笑一笑！ ♪
Dialogue: 5,0:30:32.56,0:30:35.06,Main-207+,Yasuie,0,0,0,,♪ 你就得笑一笑！ ♪
Dialogue: 5,0:30:42.02,0:30:45.24,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,別等了！快讓我瞧瞧她們！
Dialogue: 5,0:30:45.24,0:30:47.49,Main-207+,Official,0,0,0,,稍等片刻，大人！
Dialogue: 5,0:30:48.74,0:30:53.24,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,哦，對了！這些姑娘美極了！美極了！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:30:57.83,0:31:01.99,Main-207+,Official,0,0,0,,大、大人，您還滿意嗎？{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:31:01.99,0:31:04.88,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,她們……真是美豔動人！
Dialogue: 5,0:31:06.20,0:31:10.43,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,簡直絕妙！立刻開始\N宴會吧！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:31:10.43,0:31:11.68,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 5,0:31:11.68,0:31:13.30,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,舞！
Dialogue: 5,0:31:13.30,0:31:15.14,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,唱！
Dialogue: 5,0:31:15.14,0:31:18.05,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,別客氣！
Dialogue: 5,0:31:27.40,0:31:29.40,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,我來了，大人……{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:31:39.00,0:31:42.79,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,哦，小紫！我好想妳啊！
Dialogue: 5,0:31:44.11,0:31:46.34,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,我也……
Dialogue: 5,0:31:47.10,0:31:48.01,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,想您，大人。
Dialogue: 5,0:31:48.01,0:31:50.43,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,哦，妳、妳真的想我？！
Dialogue: 5,0:31:53.64,0:31:55.54,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,真的？！
Dialogue: 5,0:32:04.65,0:32:07.44,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,特拉男，你怎麼會來？
Dialogue: 5,0:32:07.44,0:32:11.49,Main-207+,Law,0,0,0,,有緊急狀況。\N你得躲起來，黑腳。
Dialogue: 5,0:32:12.41,0:32:16.20,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,是為了剛才那場架嗎？他們\N要是再來，我再揍一頓就是了。
Dialogue: 5,0:32:16.20,0:32:17.66,Main-207+,Law,0,0,0,,不是那回事。
Dialogue: 5,0:32:18.50,0:32:21.08,Main-207+,Law,0,0,0,,要來的那些人認得我們的臉！
Dialogue: 5,0:32:22.99,0:32:24.00,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,是霍金斯嗎？
Dialogue: 5,0:32:24.00,0:32:27.59,Main-207+,Law,0,0,0,,要只是他倒還不算太糟……
Dialogue: 5,0:32:28.50,0:32:32.60,Main-207+,Law,0,0,0,,六名最強的真打\N被稱為飛六胞。
Dialogue: 5,0:32:33.39,0:32:34.89,Main-207+,Law,0,0,0,,其中兩人正往這兒來。
Dialogue: 5,0:32:34.89,0:32:36.05,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,兩個？
Dialogue: 5,0:32:36.05,0:32:40.27,Main-207+,Law,0,0,0,,第一個是飛六胞的培濟萬。{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:32:49.48,0:32:52.65,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,飛六胞……培濟萬……
Dialogue: 5,0:32:52.65,0:32:57.83,Main-207+,Law,0,0,0,,另一個是飛六胞的X·德雷克。
Dialogue: 5,0:32:57.83,0:32:59.90,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,德雷克……
Dialogue: 5,0:32:59.90,0:33:02.54,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,他是最惡世代的一員……
Dialogue: 5,0:33:06.80,0:33:12.05,Main-207+,Drake,0,0,0,,培濟萬，為什麼是{\i1}我們{\i0}\N來做這種差事？
Dialogue: 5,0:33:17.43,0:33:19.50,Main-207+,Page One,0,0,0,,大概是要殺雞儆猴吧……
Dialogue: 5,0:33:19.50,0:33:28.34,Main-207+,Page One,0,0,0,,我們得讓他們見識見識，\N在和之國跟百獸海賊團作對的下場。
Dialogue: 5,0:33:28.34,0:33:31.03,Main-207+,Drake,0,0,0,,那麼，你怎麼會在這兒……
Dialogue: 5,0:33:31.53,0:33:32.81,Main-207+,Drake,0,0,0,,霍金斯？
Dialogue: 5,0:33:32.81,0:33:35.46,Main-207+,Hawkins,0,0,0,,我在找一個人。
Dialogue: 5,0:33:35.46,0:33:40.28,Main-207+,Hawkins,0,0,0,,這份差事會讓你\N大出所料，德雷克……
Dialogue: 5,0:33:48.54,0:33:53.84,Main-207+,Caribou,0,0,0,,老大，你考慮過\N我剛才的提議了嗎？
Dialogue: 5,0:33:53.84,0:33:58.62,Main-207+,Caribou,0,0,0,,你要越獄的話，\N帶我一起走！
Dialogue: 5,0:33:58.62,0:34:00.93,Main-207+,Caribou,0,0,0,,我什麼都願意做！
Dialogue: 5,0:34:00.93,0:34:05.77,Main-207+,Caribou,0,0,0,,我們要是聯手，就無人能擋！
Dialogue: 5,0:34:05.77,0:34:09.54,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,別再囉嗦了！你怎麼\N不去跟傑基聯手？！
Dialogue: 5,0:34:09.54,0:34:11.07,Main-207+,Caribou,0,0,0,,你是說基德？
Dialogue: 5,0:34:11.07,0:34:15.66,Main-207+,Caribou,0,0,0,,免了。他名聲爛透了。
Dialogue: 5,0:34:15.66,0:34:21.87,Main-207+,Caribou,0,0,0,,你聽說了嗎？他竟然\N想扳倒大媽！
Dialogue: 5,0:34:21.87,0:34:27.11,Main-207+,Caribou,0,0,0,,傳言說是她的一個手下——\N而不是她本人——砍掉了他的手臂，{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:34:27.11,0:34:29.84,Main-207+,Caribou,0,0,0,,之後他就逃跑了！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:34:30.88,0:34:34.72,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,傳言？聽那種鬼話\N可真沒出息。
Dialogue: 5,0:34:34.97,0:34:41.22,Main-207+,Caribou,0,0,0,,不，我是從可靠的人\N那兒聽來的，老大。
Dialogue: 5,0:34:44.48,0:34:47.94,Main-207+,Kid,0,0,0,,這消息是誰說的？
Dialogue: 5,0:34:47.94,0:34:52.36,Main-207+,Kid,0,0,0,,我從來沒想過要扳倒大媽！
Dialogue: 5,0:34:52.36,0:34:55.10,Main-207+,Caribou,0,0,0,,基、基、基、基德！
Dialogue: 5,0:34:55.10,0:34:58.00,Main-207+,Kid,0,0,0,,我只是打傷了她一個甜點將星，
Dialogue: 5,0:34:58.00,0:35:00.70,Main-207+,Kid,0,0,0,,拿走我想要的東西就走了！
Dialogue: 5,0:35:00.70,0:35:03.24,Main-207+,Caribou,0,0,0,,但、但、但、但你的手臂……
Dialogue: 5,0:35:03.24,0:35:09.58,Main-207+,Kid,0,0,0,,我早在那之前就失去手臂了，\N是在跟紅髮海賊團一戰時斷的。
Dialogue: 5,0:35:12.30,0:35:14.15,Main-207+,Kid,0,0,0,,還有別的問題嗎？！
Dialogue: 5,0:35:14.15,0:35:14.88,Main-207+,Caribou,0,0,0,,沒有了。
Dialogue: 5,0:35:14.88,0:35:20.38,Main-207+,Kid,0,0,0,,那麼，我告訴你們一件事！\N你也給我聽好了，你這蠢猴子！
Dialogue: 5,0:35:20.38,0:35:21.34,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 5,0:35:22.01,0:35:25.90,Main-207+,Kid,0,0,0,,要扳倒凱多、\N搶下這份榮耀的人，會是我！
Dialogue: 5,0:35:25.90,0:35:27.88,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,不，是我！
Dialogue: 5,0:35:27.88,0:35:28.77,Main-207+,Kid,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 5,0:35:38.57,0:35:42.70,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,各位，火祭就快到了！
Dialogue: 5,0:35:42.70,0:35:45.03,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,就把這場宴會當成開場戲吧！
Dialogue: 5,0:35:45.03,0:35:48.41,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,儘管盡情享樂吧！
Dialogue: 5,0:35:48.41,0:35:51.92,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,這裡可是和之國！
Dialogue: 5,0:35:51.92,0:35:54.34,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,簡直就像身在天堂！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:35:54.34,0:35:57.71,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,盡情吃喝，直到心滿意足！
Dialogue: 5,0:36:06.04,0:36:10.35,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,有艘巨大的船正從\N東南方逼近！
Dialogue: 5,0:36:12.02,0:36:14.52,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,她真的來了！
Dialogue: 5,0:36:15.20,0:36:17.07,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,轟沉他們！
Dialogue: 5,0:36:17.07,0:36:19.92,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,別讓她進入這個國家！
Dialogue: 5,0:36:19.92,0:36:23.91,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,但有個問題……
Dialogue: 5,0:36:30.08,0:36:34.92,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,有鯉魚在拉他們的船，\N他們正往前猛衝！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:36:34.92,0:36:36.60,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 5,0:36:36.60,0:36:40.09,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,他們怎麼知道\N該如何爬上瀑布的？！
Dialogue: 5,0:36:40.09,0:36:46.18,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,這個嘛，大媽海賊團\N向來以情報靈通聞名。
Dialogue: 5,0:36:46.18,0:36:49.10,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,閉嘴！我才不管！
Dialogue: 5,0:36:49.10,0:36:51.89,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,我們早知道他們要來了！
Dialogue: 5,0:36:51.89,0:36:54.19,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,快把他們擊沉就是了！
Dialogue: 5,0:37:00.20,0:37:07.62,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,那老太婆！她肯定\N記得我警告過她……
Dialogue: 5,0:37:07.62,0:37:12.83,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,妳敢來這裡我就宰了妳，莉莉！
Dialogue: 5,0:38:46.89,0:38:50.87,Main-207+,Linlin,0,0,0,,我不會放你走的，草帽小子……
